- PHP syntax on PHP 8.2 and PHP 8.3.
- JavaScript syntax on Node 22.
- Focused analytics/diagnostics contract validation.
- Canonical migration manifest validation.
- Existing Hosted Games, Standard v1, layout, and campaign regressions remain in scope.

