- Plane root `.env`: browser-facing `VITE_FREEFRAME_REVIEW_EMBED_URL` (requires rebuilding `web`);
- Plane `apps/api/.env`: server-side FreeFrame API URL and integration JWT settings;
- FreeFrame `.env.prod`: matching dedicated secret, Plane base URL and exact embed origin allowlist.

