Runtime reproduction: opening `SB-5` directly at `/browse/SB-5/` rendered the FreeFrame picker, but opening the same work item from the project list rendered Plane's separate peek tree, where the FreeFrame component was absent. Closing and reopening therefore appeared to lose the integration even though the link/session data was unchanged.

Minimal fix in `b67291341424438597f8838d1a1dca71347d2897`: render `FreeFrameReviewEmbed` in both peek layouts (`side-peek`/`modal` and `full-screen`) before Activity, matching the full work-item page.

